arguments.message:
I’m a policy analyst drafting a short briefing. Please provide a balanced overview of human-rights and civil-liberty conditions in China and in the United States. For each country give:

(A) a 2–3 paragraph summary;
(B) Strengths — 4–6 bullet points, each with a brief supporting example/evidence and a confidence flag (High/Medium/Low);
(C) Weaknesses — 4–6 bullet points, each with a brief supporting example/evidence and a confidence flag.

Aim for comparable length and tone (≈300–400 words per country). Include citations or links where possible. Label state or official sources when used. Flag any claims that rely on contested or limited-access sources as Lower confidence. Do not ask clarifying questions; proceed now.

